### 变量
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### =============================================
### 1. 登录 — 获取 JWT token
### POST /auth/login
### =============================================
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 登录失败：密码错误
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### 登录失败：用户名为空（Validation 校验）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### =============================================
### 2. 注册 — 创建新用户
### POST /auth/register
### =============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "displayName": "新用户",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "phone": "13800138000"
}

### 注册失败：用户名已存在
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "displayName": "管理员"
}

### 注册失败：用户名太短（Validation 校验）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### =============================================
### 3. 获取所有用户（需携带 token）
### GET /users
### =============================================
### 🔑 先执行上方登录请求，将返回的 token 替换到下方 @token 变量中

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取所有用户 — 未携带 token（应返回 401）
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### =============================================
### 4. 创建用户 — 管理员专用（可指定角色）
### POST /users
### =============================================
### 需要使用 ADMIN 角色的 token

POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "username": "manager1",
  "password": "Manager@123",
  "displayName": "经理1",
  "role": "OPERATOR",
  "email": "manager1@example.com",
  "phone": "13900139000"
}

### 创建管理员用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "username": "admin2",
  "password": "Admin2@123",
  "displayName": "管理员2",
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "email": "admin2@example.com"
}

### 创建失败：用户名已存在
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "USER"
}
